@startuml Vihmart Sequence Diagram

header Vihmart Project Architecture
title Sequence Diagram - Request Lifecycle

actor "User / Admin" as User
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "index.php\n(Entry Point)" as Index
participant "routing.php\n(Router)" as Router
participant "Controller" as Controller
participant "Model" as Model
database "Database" as DB
participant "View / Layout" as View

== Public Site Flow ==

User -> Browser: Request URL (e.g., /shop)
Browser -> Index: GET /vihmart/en/shop
Index -> Index: session_start()\nLoad .env\nLoad DB & Classes
Index -> Router: Include route/routing.php
Router -> Router: Parse URI & Language
Router -> Controller: Controller::AllArtsShop()
activate Controller
Controller -> Model: Arts::getArtsByCategoryInShop()
activate Model
Model -> DB: SQL Query
activate DB
DB --> Model: Result Set
deactivate DB
Model --> Controller: Arts Data
deactivate Model
Controller -> View: render('allArtsShop', data)
activate View
View -> View: Include view/allArtsShop.php (content)
View -> View: Include view/layout.php (wrapper)
View --> Controller: Compiled HTML
deactivate View
Controller --> Router: HTML Response
deactivate Controller
Router --> Index: $response
Index --> Browser: echo $response
Browser --> User: Display Page

== Admin Panel Flow ==

User -> Browser: Request URL (e.g., /admin/artsList)
Browser -> Index: GET /vihmart/admin/artsList
Index -> Router: Include admin/routeAdmin/routingAdmin.php
Router -> Controller: controllerAdmin::AllArts()
activate Controller
Controller -> Model: adminArts::getAllArts()
activate Model
Model -> DB: SQL Query
activate DB
DB --> Model: Result Set
deactivate DB
Model --> Controller: Arts Data
deactivate Model
Controller -> View: renderAdmin('artsList', data)
activate View
View --> Controller: Compiled HTML
deactivate View
Controller --> Router: HTML Response
deactivate Controller
Router --> Index: $response
Index --> Browser: echo $response
Browser --> User: Display Admin Table

@enduml
